<title>NETHERLANDS: ASM LITHO 1996 EPS RISIS 57 PCT.</title>
<headline>ASM LITHO 1996 EPS RISIS 57 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     6.36 vs   4.06</p>
<p>    Net profit			   217.7  vs 131.4</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)		  1.33 vs   0.92</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   335.8  vs 208.9</p>
<p>    Tax				    117.7  vs  76.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had expected ASM Lithography, which is 35</p>
<p>percent owned by Philips Electronics , to post a 1996</p>
<p>net profit of 210 million to 241 million guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
